msgid "<span id=\"generate_preset_pass_manager\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"generate_preset_pass_manager\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Changes to `generate_preset_pass_manager` interface {#changes-to-generate-"
"preset-pass-manager-interface}"
msgstr ""
"การเปลี่ยนแปลง interface ของ `generate_preset_pass_manager` {#changes-to-"
"generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 includes a series of updates to the preset pass manager interface (that is, the\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) and\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) functions) that affect the\n"
"handling of loose constraint inputs, such as `coupling_map` or `basis_gates`. The number of\n"
"transpilation use cases where loose constraints are accepted has been reduced in favor of the\n"
"`target` and `backend` inputs (where `backend` is a [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) that\n"
"contains a [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"which allow for a more expressive communication of these constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 รวมการอัปเดตหลายอย่างสำหรับ preset pass manager interface (คือ\n"
"ฟังก์ชัน [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) และ\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile)) ที่ส่งผลต่อ\n"
"การจัดการ loose constraint inputs เช่น `coupling_map` หรือ `basis_gates` จำนวน\n"
"transpilation use cases ที่รับ loose constraints ได้ลดลงเพื่อสนับสนุน\n"
"inputs `target` และ `backend` (ที่ `backend` คือ [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) ที่\n"
"ประกอบด้วย instance ของ [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target))\n"
"ซึ่งช่วยให้สื่อสาร constraints เหล่านี้ได้มีฟีเจอร์มากขึ้น\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples show the main changes and suggested alternatives for migrating. Note that all\n"
"of the migration tips below apply to both `transpile` and `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"
msgstr ""
"ตัวอย่างต่อไปนี้แสดงการเปลี่ยนแปลงหลักและ alternatives ที่แนะนำสำหรับ "
"migration หมายเหตุว่า migration tips ทั้งหมดด้านล่างนำไปใช้กับทั้ง "
"`transpile` และ `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend_properties` input argument is no longer supported, and the `BackendProperties` class has\n"
"been removed. You should use the `target` or `backend` arguments instead to communicate\n"
"gate durations and errors. There are multiple paths for constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"
msgstr ""
"input argument `backend_properties` ไม่รองรับอีกต่อไป และ class `BackendProperties` ถูกลบออกแล้ว ควรใช้ arguments `target` หรือ `backend` แทนเพื่อสื่อสาร\n"
"gate durations และ errors มี paths หลายทางในการสร้าง custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  a. Build a target from scratch and add the relevant errors and durations "
"to the corresponding gates:\n"
msgstr ""
"  a. สร้าง target ตั้งแต่ต้นและเพิ่ม errors และ durations ที่เกี่ยวข้องไปยัง"
" gates ที่สอดคล้องกัน:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"
msgstr "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  b. Use [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) to quickly build a\n"
"     generic target with pre-filled errors and durations. These can also be updated post-construction:\n"
msgstr ""
"  b. ใช้ [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) เพื่อสร้าง\n"
"     generic target พร้อม errors และ durations ที่กรอกไว้ล่วงหน้าได้อย่างรวดเร็ว ซึ่งสามารถอัปเดตได้หลัง construction:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. The `instruction_durations` and `timing_constraints` input arguments are no longer supported. You should use the\n"
"  `target` or `backend` arguments instead. The alternatives are constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) from\n"
"  scratch, constructing a generic backend, and, in addition to these, it is possible to build a custom target with\n"
"  `instruction_durations` and/or `timing_constraints` using the `Target.from_configuration` method:\n"
msgstr ""
"2. input arguments `instruction_durations` และ `timing_constraints` ไม่รองรับอีกต่อไป ควรใช้\n"
"  arguments `target` หรือ `backend` แทน alternatives คือการสร้าง custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) ตั้งแต่ต้น การสร้าง generic backend และนอกจากนี้ยังสามารถสร้าง custom target ด้วย\n"
"  `instruction_durations` และ/หรือ `timing_constraints` โดยใช้ method `Target.from_configuration`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"
msgstr ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"
msgstr ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Providing `coupling_map` and/or `basis_gates` along with a `backend` is discouraged, and from\n"
"  v2.0 a `UserWarning` will be raised. In these cases there are multiple sources of truth,\n"
"  and information such as gate errors and durations from the backend cannot be resolved based on the\n"
"  information given.\n"
"  The suggested alternative is to define a custom target that combines the chosen constraints either\n"
"  from scratch, using [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) or [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"3. การระบุ `coupling_map` และ/หรือ `basis_gates` พร้อมกับ `backend` ไม่แนะนำ และตั้งแต่\n"
"  v2.0 จะมีการ raise `UserWarning` ในกรณีเหล่านี้มีแหล่งข้อมูลหลายแหล่ง\n"
"  และข้อมูลเช่น gate errors และ durations จาก backend ไม่สามารถแก้ไขได้โดยอิงข้อมูลที่ให้\n"
"  alternative ที่แนะนำคือนิยาม custom target ที่รวม constraints ที่เลือกไว้\n"
"  ตั้งแต่ต้น โดยใช้ [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) หรือ [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. The `basis_gates` argument no longer accepts custom basis gates. The suggested alternative\n"
"  is the `target` argument, which can be built from scratch or through [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  such as:\n"
msgstr ""
"4. argument `basis_gates` ไม่รับ custom basis gates อีกต่อไป alternative ที่แนะนำ\n"
"  คือ argument `target` ซึ่งสร้างตั้งแต่ต้นหรือผ่าน [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  เช่น:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. The input combination where a custom `coupling_map` is provided with either a `backend` or `basis_gates`\n"
"  that contain gates with three or more qubits is no longer allowed. The coupling map\n"
"  does not provide the necessary connectivity details to be able to determine the  action of the gate.\n"
"  In these cases, the recommended migration path is the creation of a custom target from scratch.\n"
msgstr ""
"5. combination input ที่ระบุ custom `coupling_map` พร้อมกับ `backend` หรือ `basis_gates`\n"
"  ที่ประกอบด้วย gates สามหรือมากกว่า qubits ไม่ได้รับอนุญาตอีกต่อไป coupling map\n"
"  ไม่ให้รายละเอียด connectivity ที่จำเป็นเพื่อกำหนด action ของ gate\n"
"  ในกรณีเหล่านี้ migration path ที่แนะนำคือการสร้าง custom target ตั้งแต่ต้น\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. The `inst_map` argument has been removed without alternative. It was used to provide pulse information\n"
"  to the transpiler, and the full `qiskit.pulse` module has been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"6. argument `inst_map` ถูกลบออกโดยไม่มี alternative มันใช้เพื่อให้ข้อมูล pulse แก่\n"
"  transpiler และ module `qiskit.pulse` ทั้งหมดถูกลบออกแล้ว\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qiskit.pulse\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"
msgstr "qiskit.pulse {#qiskitpulse}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The module `qiskit.pulse` has been completely removed from Qiskit, without replacement.\n"
"This includes the related items:\n"
msgstr ""
"module `qiskit.pulse` ถูกลบออกจาก Qiskit อย่างสมบูรณ์ โดยไม่มีตัวแทน\n"
"ซึ่งรวมถึง items ที่เกี่ยวข้อง:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),"
" "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" and "
"[`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency)"
" property `calibrations`.\n"
msgstr ""
"property `calibrations` ของ "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),"
" "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" และ "
"[`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" methods `has_calibration_for` and `add_calibration`.\n"
msgstr ""
"methods `has_calibration_for` และ `add_calibration` ของ "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)"
" method `has_calibration_for`.\n"
msgstr ""
"method `has_calibration_for` ของ "
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the transpiler passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, "
"`RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"
msgstr ""
"transpiler passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, "
"`RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the module `qiskit.scheduler` and all its contents.\n"
msgstr "module `qiskit.scheduler` และ contents ทั้งหมด\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)"
" methods `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, "
"`acquire_channel` and `control_channel`.\n"
msgstr ""
"methods `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, "
"`acquire_channel` และ `control_channel` ของ "
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the "
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" methods `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` "
"and `update_from_instruction_schedule_map`.\n"
msgstr ""
"methods `has_calibration`, `get_calibration`, `instruction_schedule_map` และ"
" `update_from_instruction_schedule_map` ของ "
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the `inst_map` argument of "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager),"
" [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile), "
"and "
"[`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration).\n"
msgstr ""
"argument `inst_map` ของ "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager),"
" [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) "
"และ "
"[`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the `calibration` field of "
"[`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties).\n"
msgstr ""
"ฟิลด์ `calibration` ของ "
"[`InstructionProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.InstructionProperties)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This happened because IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs ceased to offer pulse-level access, and the Qiskit team no longer had resources to maintain the little-used package.\n"
"You can continue to use the `qiskit.pulse` module while using the v1.x series of Qiskit, which has bug-fix support until September 2024 and security support until March 2025, but the module is removed from the v2.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"สิ่งนี้เกิดขึ้นเพราะ IBM Quantum&reg; QPUs หยุดให้การเข้าถึงระดับ pulse และทีม Qiskit ไม่มีทรัพยากรในการดูแล package ที่ใช้น้อยนี้อีกต่อไป\n"
"คุณยังสามารถใช้ module `qiskit.pulse` ต่อไปได้ขณะใช้ Qiskit series v1.x ซึ่งมีการรองรับ bug-fix จนถึงกันยายน 2024 และ security support จนถึงมีนาคม 2025 แต่ module นี้ถูกลบออกจาก series v2.x\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most uses of `qiskit.pulse` can be replaced with direct access to fractional gates on IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (and later generations, if applicable).\n"
"You can read more in [the migration guide for converted pulse usage to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"การใช้งาน `qiskit.pulse` ส่วนใหญ่สามารถแทนได้ด้วยการเข้าถึง fractional gates โดยตรงบน IBM Quantum Heron QPUs (และรุ่นต่อๆ ไป หากมี)\n"
"อ่านเพิ่มเติมใน [คู่มือ migration สำหรับการแปลง pulse เป็น fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can no longer load QPY files that contain `ScheduleBlock` objects in Qiskit v2.0 because of the removal of Qiskit Pulse.\n"
"You can continue to load these files in the Qiskit v1.x series.\n"
msgstr ""
"คุณไม่สามารถ load QPY files ที่ประกอบด้วย `ScheduleBlock` objects ใน Qiskit v2.0 ได้อีกต่อไปเนื่องจากการลบ Qiskit Pulse\n"
"คุณยังสามารถ load files เหล่านี้ใน Qiskit series v1.x ต่อไปได้\n"
